# Hands: grab to use a cargo container. A grip with the palm at the container's use spot takes hold and uses it, as the use
# key does at a flat screen: its inventory opens.
# World: Earth Planet (survival, on foot, in gravity). A small cargo container is built 1.7 m ahead, centred at chest
# height. The palm position is a first guess: tune it from the "Grab use: right palm N cm from" lines in the log.

plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet

# ---- What the world needs: a small cargo container (a large block, 2.5 m) in front of the character -------------------------

admin creativeTools
# out of the starter base, where nothing is built within 10 m, to build there
goto open
build LargeBlockSmallContainer 3 as Test cargo
goto Test cargo 1.7
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60

head 0 1.6 0
hand left -0.25 1.0 -0.2
# The right palm reaches out to the container's near face, 45 cm ahead.
hand right 0.1 1.25 -0.45
wait 1
# Before: only the game is up.
read screen
expect type == MyGuiScreenGamePlay
expect no log Grab use: right hand took hold

# ---- Grip: the hand takes hold; let go, it is used -> the inventory screen opens -------------------------------------------
# (the use waits for the grip to be let go, so the screen does not open under a held grip)

press right grip
wait 1.5
expect log Grab use: right hand took hold of within 5
release right grip
wait 1.5
expect log Grab use: right hand used within 5
read screens
expect result contains MyGuiScreenTerminal
# B goes back: the screen closes and the game has the focus again.
press right b
wait 0.2
release right b
wait 1.5
read screen
expect type == MyGuiScreenGamePlay
expect no log Exception
